  "description": "A feast for the eyes as well as the stomach, this salad is a true celebration of the sweet and nuttiness that can be found in a savoury dish. Between creamy sweet potato and beetroot, mild chevre goat cheese and crunchy toasted pecans, you won’t be able to decide what to eat first!",
